Package: aidatabroker
Type: Package
Title: Read Licensed Market Data on AI Training Data
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("Yuma", "Heymans", email = "hello@aidata.broker", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Reads the tables that 'AIData.Broker' keeps on the market for AI
    training data (prices, licensing deals, buyers, vendors, lawsuits and
    related tables, each row with its source) for holders of its Market Data
    Licence, using the licence's API key. Since 11 November 2026 the tables
    are sold under that licence, not published openly; see
    <https://aidata.broker/datasets> for the licence and its terms.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://aidata.broker/datasets
Depends: R (>= 3.6.0)
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports: utils
NeedsCompilation: no
Packaged: 2026-11-12 01:52:09 UTC; yuma2
Author: Yuma Heymans [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Yuma Heymans <hello@aidata.broker>
Repository: CRAN
Date/Publication: 2026-11-12 14:50:21 UTC
